WEBVTT

00:13:29.416 --> 00:13:31.712
of the world's oil and mining companies

00:13:31.736 --> 00:13:35.483
are now covered by transparency laws.
Two thirds.

00:13:35.507 --> 00:13:36.956
So this is change happening.

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.846
This is progress.

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:41.969
But we're not there yet, by far.

00:13:41.993 --> 00:13:44.215
Because it really isn't about corruption

00:13:44.239 --> 00:13:46.330
somewhere over there, is it?

00:13:46.354 --> 00:13:48.535
In a globalized world, corruption

00:13:48.559 --> 00:13:50.798
is a truly globalized business,

00:13:50.822 --> 00:13:52.913
and one that needs global solutions,

00:13:52.937 --> 00:13:56.913
supported and pushed by us
all, as global citizens,

00:13:56.937 --> 00:13:58.075
right here.

00:13:58.099 --> 00:13:59.265
Thank you.

00:13:59.289 --> 00:14:06.105
(Applause)